This repository is a curated merge of upstream, MIT-licensed skill libraries.
For the three `thinking-models/`, `context-engineering/`, and
`thinking-partner/` categories, each skill's body is included verbatim from its
source. The `coding-skill/` category holds short methodology skills distilled
(not copied verbatim) from the community skills credited below. Copyright in
each skill remains with its original author:

- thinking-models/      — Copyright (c) tjboudreaux
                          https://github.com/tjboudreaux/cc-thinking-skills
- context-engineering/  — Copyright (c) Muratcan Koylan
                          https://github.com/muratcankoylan/agent-skills-for-context-engineering
- thinking-partner/     — Copyright (c) mattnowdev
                          https://github.com/mattnowdev/thinking-partner
- coding-skill/         — distilled from, with credit to:
                          caveman  — https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
                                     https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman
                          handoff  — https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
                          karpathy-agent-discipline
                                   — https://github.com/multica-ai/andrej-karpathy-skills
                                     https://github.com/forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills

